lines=['# Analysis of all 15 routes downloaded October 3','', 'All 290 full rlogs (3,011,933,837 bytes) match their source SHA-256 hashes, decompress successfully and parse without errors. Each route has contiguous segment numbers starting at zero. The collection includes the three newly added routes 11, 12 and 13. Eligible tracking coverage now totals 159.09 minutes.','', '## Main findings','', 'Routes 05, 10, 11 and 12 contain active lateral control. All 15 routes use torqueState messages and report the same stock EPS identity `39990-THR-A020`. The previous angle-PID kpV/kiV comparison does not directly apply. A firmware version string does not prove the installed firmware bytes or R2 status.','', 'The estimator reaches a valid 100% calibration during route 05 and retains valid cached calibration through subsequent sessions. Routes 06–0f have no active lateral control, and their estimator point count remains 9,174: filtered values continue changing on existing data, which is not independent new calibration evidence. Route 10 adds data and finishes at 10,835 bucket points. Calibration 100% is the estimator’s coverage/validity indication, not proof of physical torque accuracy or parameter convergence.','', '## Active-drive tracking','', '| Route | Eligible minutes | Mean absolute error (m/s²) | P95 absolute error (m/s²) | Command ≥95% | Saturation flag |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
for r in active:
 s=r['qualified'];lines.append(f"| {r['route']} | {s['seconds']/60:.2f} | {s['mae']:.4f} | {s['p95']:.4f} | {s['near_limit_pct']:.3f}% | {s['saturated_pct']:.3f}% |")
lines+=['','Route 10 has higher tracking errors than route 05, but these are different drives and road/speed distributions. This is not a controlled tuning comparison. Across eligible samples, command magnitude reaches 95% for 41.28 seconds; no inference about physical torque in N·m follows from normalized output.','', '## Every route','', '| Route | Segments | Active minutes | Eligible minutes | Final factor | Final offset | Final friction |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
